# The passphrase never reaches a remote view: the web's facts table and its JSON model (for the
# owner and for a guest) and the MCP tool's state hold no function 250 row and no encoded code, and
# no profile can make the passphrase or the firmware update a control.
bins/svolderd/src/web/view/tests.rs|the_passphrase_never_reaches_a_remote_view_in_the_facts
bins/svolderd/src/web/model/tests.rs|the_passphrase_never_reaches_the_model
bins/svolderd/src/mcp/tools/tests.rs|the_passphrase_never_reaches_a_remote_view_in_get_state
