crates/svolder-profiles/src/registry/tests.rs|an_action_on_a_restricted_function_is_refused

# A device preset never reaches the device unasked or by the wrong door: a built-in setting never
# names the volume or the mode, a save needs its confirmation (CLI, TUI, web) or is not offered
# (MCP, MQTT), a recall through MCP asks first naming the highest level it can reach, and an
# action key is never a plain control write.
crates/svolder-profiles/src/registry/tests.rs|a_builtin_setting_can_only_name_level_controls
crates/svolder-profiles/src/registry/tests.rs|a_builtin_setting_cannot_name_the_volume
